<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 18/19.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 18/19.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Monday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for August 19. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   19.08.97	  18.08.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.4326	    6.3644</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2127	    2.1757</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.3440	    4.2760</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4120	    3.3870</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5052	    0.4990</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7380	    0.7263</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2760	    0.2719</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8758	    6.8219</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6879	    0.6880</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1519	    1.1463</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
